:0.0293,"r5":0.0316,"r20":-0.0065,"r1_spy":0.0313,"r5_spy":0.0326,"r20_spy":0.0059}},{"id":"TOST 2026 Q3","t":"TOST","d":"2026-11-03","time":"amc","w":6941,"n":38,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/toast-tost-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[1,1,0,1.46],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[1,0,1,1.46],"guidance":[1,1,0,1.46,{"raise":1,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0549,"r5":0.0295,"r1_spy":0.0384,"r5_spy":0.0354}}],"quotes":[{"c":"TOST 2021 Q4","e":"tost","d":"2022-02-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elena Gomez","x":"Our business is performing well, and there's enormous demand for the Toast platform as restaurants need to streamline their operations, increase revenue, and retain great employees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/17/toast-inc-tost-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2022 Q1","e":"tost","d":"2022-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Comparato","x":"So we think that trend will continue, and we think the consumer demand is high, and we believe that restaurants have pricing power to play with pricing to continue to serve those consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/toast-inc-tost-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2022 Q1","e":"tost","d":"2022-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Timothy Chiodo","x":"I was just wondering if you could just give a comment on what might be implied there for that stability for the rest of the year, particularly in light of the comments that you made around some of the cost savings initiatives in terms of the shipping costs that you might be looking at?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/toast-inc-tost-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2022 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2022-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Comparato","x":"As part of the expanded relationship, Jamba is piloting the addition of the Toast kiosk product to streamline checkout and help combat heightened labor costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/11/toast-inc-tost-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2022 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2022-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elena Gomez","x":"Our decision to strategically increase inventory not only drives cost savings on shipping, but also insulates us from short-term supply chain disruptions, allowing us to continue to seamlessly serve our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/11/toast-inc-tost-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2022 Q3","e":"tost","d":"2022-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Comparato","x":"They went live with invoicing in June at 19 of their Dos Toros locations in order to streamline their operations and payments for catering into one platform after previously using a separate point solution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/toast-inc-tost-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2022 Q4","e":"tost","d":"2023-02-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Timothy Chiodo","x":"And there's also been some reports of tests of price increases that you've been considering in the marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/16/toast-tost-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2022 Q4","e":"tost","d":"2023-02-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Comparato","x":"Over 5,000 customers have already used our invoicing product to streamline their billing and payment processes and with an average transaction value over $650, it's also an opportunity for these customers to grow their business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/16/toast-tost-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q1","e":"tost","d":"2023-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Aman Narang","x":"But in terms of the wholesale price increase, that's not something we've done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/toast-tost-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q1","e":"tost","d":"2023-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Will Nance","x":"On the payment side, there's been kind of a lot out there in the market on price increases just in the acquiring space overall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/toast-tost-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q1","e":"tost","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Comparato","x":"Back of house, our payroll and team management solution will streamline onboarding and scheduling with their sizable seasonal employee base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/toast-tost-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q1","e":"tost","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Comparato","x":"McMenaman was attracted to Toast to help streamline operations and to leverage our powerful partner integrations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/toast-tost-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2023-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Samad Samana","x":"There's no assumption on a price increase based into at least the outlook for the rest of the year, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/toast-tost-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2023-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Samad Samana","x":"And I guess when we think about price increase, should we think about that based on the comments that you've given?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/toast-tost-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2023-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aman Narang","x":"This includes our Toast Go handhelds in their Dining Rooms, Kitchen Displaces System to streamline kitchen operations, Toast Tables to manage reservations, Mobile Order and Pay to streamline front-of-house service, and loyalty gift cards and email marketing to turn guests into regulars.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/toast-tost-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2023-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aman Narang","x":"Customers love the core capabilities that help streamline restaurant operations, and our R&D team is hard at work listening to our customers and making more of our platform capabilities available to them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/toast-tost-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2023-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elena Gomez","x":"Following our solid first-half performance, we are increasing our full-year guidance and now expect full-year revenue to be in the range of $3.81 billion to $3.87 billion, a 41% year-over-year increase at the midpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/toast-tost-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q2","e":"tost","d":"2023-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Kupferberg","x":"You raised the outlook there for the second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/toast-tost-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TOST 2023 Q3","e":"tost","d":"2023-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aman Narang","x":"They purchased nine products to help streamline their business across both front-of-house and back-of-house and noted the simplicity and ease of use of an integrated all-in-one solution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/0